[{"title":"金山","author":"然修","text":"苍茫落日下藤萝，身在荆关画里过。\n飞去断云双白鸟，浴残寒浪一青螺。\n蕲王有庙疏烟冷，郭璞无坟乱石多。\n千古寂寥俱莫问，且听江月送渔歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29137,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝笔诗","author":"然修","text":"道我狂时不是狂，今朝收拾臭皮囊。\n雪中明月团团冷，火里莲花瓣瓣香。\n好向棒头寻出路，即从业海驾归航。\n满炉榾柮都煨烬，十字街头作道场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29138,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"马鞍山过寒岩大师","author":"超际","text":"携筇独入翠微閒，老树青山愧此颜。\n倚槛静看花落去，听泉常趁月明还。\n鹤归峰顶松涛寂，磬出孤云石洞閒。\n欲访远公成夜宿，寂寥清梦绕禅关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29139,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扫先慈墓","author":"超群","text":"慈母多笑容，至今不敢忘。\n岂意拜墓时，松柏参差长。\n遥忆儿嬉日，瞪目徒心伤。\n一思分我食，载思缝我裳。\n昊天宜罔极，延伫何徬徨。\n挂纸聊复去，落日沈高冈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29140,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日","author":"超群","text":"佳节偏多雨，翻增旅客愁。\n高堂虚白日，空谷自清秋。\n世上无相识，天涯亦浪游。\n故园今日菊，谁插老亲头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29141,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏新竹","author":"际?","text":"此君志欲擎天碧，耸出云头高百尺。\n只恐年深化作龙，一朝飞去不留迹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29142,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重游回澜寺 其一","author":"际?","text":"百里支筇再到游，诗人元自爱探幽。\n不须买得村头酒，醉杀满庭黄叶秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29143,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重游回澜寺 其二","author":"际?","text":"名山自古号回澜，信是钤阳第一观。\n上下蒲帆轻若叶，游人好作画图看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29144,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游朱陵观","author":"际?","text":"洞天三十六，于此最称奇。\n高阁飞云入，断桥流水澌。\n鸟鸣谈道处，花落炼丹池。\n仙去多遗迹，低徊动感思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29145,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庭芳同学受法诗以寄之","author":"际?","text":"自从合派泉边别，地北天南各一方。\n仍向龙须同法乳，新诗特寄两三行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29146,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居","author":"明愚","text":"参到真空妄始删，此心犹未尽缘攀。\n潺湲涧底仍知水，层叠云中尚见山。\n世有万般趋热恼，我惟一味向清閒。\n两头坐断中何立，方契宗乘最上关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29147,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"到天居偶作","author":"明愚","text":"卷上疏帘便见天，用心多错悔从前。\n是山是水原如此，非我非渠总湛然。\n宿业销除尘不染，新机显露理俱全。\n光阴真叹如驹驶，一瞬匆匆六十年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29148,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"葛洪洞","author":"寂镫","text":"山色摇光入袖凉，松根风细茯苓香。\n局残柯烂人何在，深洞寒云锁夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29149,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题簪花图","author":"上睿","text":"莫摘秾香压鬓鸦，懒将时势斗铅华。\n他年得入维摩室，不许簪花许散花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29150,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"出家时答伯兄见虚","author":"生庵","text":"辽东白鹤归来日，不记人间几岁华。\n庭内已分连理树，堂前须种解忧花。\n相思频寄云中雁，得句空镂江上沙。\n欲觅当前乾净土，可知安养是吾家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29151,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆洞庭吴不官","author":"慈视","text":"贫贱亦行役，风尘了不关。\n心如太湖水，家在洞庭山。\n作客有时倦，吟诗无日闲。\n泉台遇同调，曾否忆人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29152,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江行","author":"通琇","text":"天地本无碍，乘风且浪游。\n岸疑随舫动，星故逆云流。\n小憩闲临水，高吟晚上楼。\n宁知人代里，不复有丹邱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29153,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"通际","text":"半生埋涧壑，幽事逐清真。\n煮雪消残夜，推窗见早春。\n得教双眼阔，不厌一身贫。\n坐拨炉中烬，红轮特地新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29154,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"周逸休鸿胪见过","author":"通问","text":"庞眉不减鹿门风，杖履欣从世外通。\n共对落霞追野鹜，正宜秋色醉冥鸿。\n一沤未发机方息，万梦俱醒劫始空。\n把臂莫辞烟路远，好山青送夕阳中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29155,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠倪端甫","author":"通忍","text":"处士高风山并高，浩歌多半是牢骚。\n可怜冠盖今何在，剩得南村一布袍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29156,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀州隐","author":"通门","text":"落花寂寂鸟双双，新竹成阴绿满窗。\n梦听潮声来枕上，几年不得到娄江。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29157,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"遣意","author":"悟持","text":"小幄镫翻夜影寒，年来已泯旧悲欢。\n事无过望心常稳，世可相忘梦亦安。\n插架任教千卷破，囊空何用一钱看。\n衡茅拟筑枫江上，吟尽西风万木丹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29158,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见远山残雪","author":"大健","text":"已觉寒威去，犹瞻雪在山。\n清深通竹路，虚白映松关。\n片石能相偶，孤云无此閒。\n好将寥落意，指点到人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29159,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杜茶村见过","author":"大健","text":"芦荻晚苍苍，烟岚在下方。\n兰舟维此际，萍迹任他乡。\n风浪矶前大，僧衣世外长。\n艰辛今夕会，江海意难忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29160,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山房同端白迟兰公不至","author":"显谟","text":"林下掩荆扉，白日忽已暝。\n松风阴壑生，淅沥寒秋听。\n相对淡忘言，诗成禅侣定。\n期子不我来，寂寂孤云径。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29161,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柬陆长卿","author":"显谟","text":"为别亦何易，山山尽是秋。\n曾期过一夜，不见到孤舟。\n风劲叶离树，月寒人在楼。\n所思湖水阔，清梦得同游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29162,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦故友程风衣","author":"超源","text":"春雨何淅淅，春云更沉沉。\n程君已隔世，宵梦来相寻。\n自言身朽心不朽，象外风月皆吾友。\n从前胶扰海天空，只是泉台无美酒。\n斜阳烟柳门前溪，欲别不别重牵衣。\n寄语淮阴小儿女，我今野鹤同翻飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29163,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"友人枉过开化寺","author":"超源","text":"青眼多情客，携朋问暮秋。\n人同山共瘦，时与水俱流。\n黄叶迷村路，清风满寺楼。\n荒凉郊外景，肯向锦囊收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29164,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"超源","text":"春浦风生柳岸斜，好山何处著人家。\n白云遮断桥西路，不许渔郎问落花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29165,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登昭阳拱极台","author":"超源","text":"寂寞昭阳客，时登拱极台。\n故山何处是，孤雁带霜来。\n羡彼收纶者，悠然鼓棹回。\n城头秋草路，蛩语为谁哀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29166,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿长安乾明寺","author":"超源","text":"湖村开晚霁，绀殿露秋林。\n鼓棹沧波远，到门黄叶深。\n茶烟禅榻静，松月客堂阴。\n一宿乾明寺，空诸万劫心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29167,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"洞庵杂咏","author":"超净","text":"枝柯挺秀势参天，耐雪经霜不记年。\n试部当初谁种得，翛然一鹤古巢边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29168,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂兴","author":"超拳","text":"鸟宿依窗树，云生对户山。\n机忘心自远，境寂意俱閒。\n花落门常掩，苔深径不删。\n松风连暮雨，双涧瀑潺潺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29169,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香岊庵落成","author":"超拳","text":"万山深处卧烟霞，收拾閒身老岁华。\n晴日晓开云岭树，清泉夜走月滩沙。\n工诗愧我非齐己，学道何人是永嘉。\n从此罕闻尘世事，编篱绕屋种梅花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29170,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿万峰精舍","author":"明中","text":"我身如孤云，去住在空谷，偶来万峰头，意倦便一宿。\n水凉山影沈，树暝人烟簇。\n夜静冷吟虫，秋声散丛竹。\n爱此风味清，得句一烧烛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29171,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"明中","text":"黛色连修林，春晓破烟霭。\n时从湖上看，偶与幽意会。\n白云何娟娟，奇姿不可绘。\n遐思辋川人，展卷坐相对。\n观妙各有得，喧寂两无碍。\n聊以物外心，参之画三昧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29172,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自西泠至东湖夜集张徵士艺舫","author":"篆玉","text":"吾杭饶野趣，平远逊东湖。\n海控天为岸，星繁水弄珠。\n昏黄城不禁，酣畅话多殊。\n明日迟归棹，留诗待补图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29173,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过披云室赠李公","author":"祖琴","text":"半亩松筠半亩溪，茅庵背结板桥西。\n听钟夜坐山前月，汲水晓浇屋后畦。\n野客不来云转静，秋花况发路还迷。\n石屏一曲和烟绿，还拨苍云觅旧题。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29174,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后待汪扶苍啜茗不至有怀","author":"祖琴","text":"草色青青门未关，茶铛閒煞曲廊閒。\n应知不下松边阁，坐看江南雨后山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29175,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辞云门梵林禅师徵诗入选和元韵","author":"兴机","text":"孤踪只合孤峰老，纵遇花时不去探。\n狐首死惟甘向北，雁声悲是悔来南。\n已将名共颠毛削，肯把诗同里巷谈。\n多感殷勤诗入选，宁知遁义少人耽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29176,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"探梅","author":"德晖","text":"老恋绳床懒出村，偶携筇杖破苔痕。\n到来晴雪迷岩谷，卧入寒云冷梦魂。\n目既成馀唯有笑，心当醉处欲忘言。\n一瓢此际真堪挂，拟剪茅茨覆筚门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29177,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乃奇禅师约同臞庵先过楚禅即事","author":"德新","text":"几竿修竹一泓池，陇畔柴扉片石支。\n有客未来茶已熟，閒将蕉叶写新诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29178,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答宝臣冬日见怀韵","author":"然明","text":"太息才华合最难，予归林下汝江干。\n绿萝院里看花落，红豆村前听鴂残。\n摇笔题诗过雪夜，拥貂暖酒入春寒。\n何时再画炉灰坐，话尽生平瞰芋团。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29179,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过访生庵访古愚上人","author":"广济","text":"古公栖隐处，极目似天涯。\n出郭不多路，沿村无几家。\n因君留午饭，啜茗看秋花。\n不觉忘归去，溪西日已斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29180,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠张瑶星先生","author":"广济","text":"山上孤峰山下溪，北窗高枕白云西。\n南溪处士多瓢笠，东郭先生只杖藜。\n避世拟凭僧出没，逃禅不仗佛提携。\n灌园种竹疏篱下，独酌深林听鸟啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29181,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访友不值","author":"海岳","text":"寻君复不见，寂寞出林间。\n落叶溪边路，浮云海外山。\n午烟桑柘隐，秋色户庭闲。\n爱尔幽栖好，归来亦闭关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29182,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望庐山","author":"德溥","text":"楚山秋霁后，突兀望匡庐。\n瀑布云开处，香炉雨过初。\n双溪才咫尺，五老在空虚。\n欲问远公迹，苍茫指点馀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29183,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送汪卜三归淮南","author":"德溥","text":"喜色眉端见，知君赋曰归。\n几回萦别绪，无计挽征衣。\n楚雨片帆下，淮烟一雁飞。\n何时重舣艇，还款老僧扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29184,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别孙雪棹","author":"德溥","text":"匆匆判袂各天涯，君返龙城我骥沙。\n料得湖园春尚在，小红开到米囊花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29185,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄山慈光寺","author":"德溥","text":"群峰围拱妙莲台，鸟道云梯十里来。\n山径曲随云脚转，寺门高压树头开。\n游人蜡屐攀初倦，佛子蒲团定已回。\n一笑相逢同领会，三生石上不须猜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29186,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日送希公上人","author":"行宏","text":"浮玉同分榻，临风思不群。\n我怀无可赠，只有半山云。\n寒雁横春雾，江梅老夕曛。\n杖藜回首处，何日更论文。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29187,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"琼花观","author":"行溗","text":"曾是随炀驻跸来，琼花何处观犹开。\n昔年古径生芳草，此日残碑长绿苔。\n寂寞笙歌游客少，凄凉风月为谁哀。\n蕃釐一去无消息，惟有閒禽噪石台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29188,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同臞庵居士过董公祠访邓孝威","author":"行溗","text":"一杖出萧寺，荒祠比邓林。\n楼高云影近，井久石痕深。\n掩卷生禅悦，焚香静客心。\n我来同孝穆，户外听微吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29189,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三师石塔","author":"行溗","text":"潭北湘南六百年，只图无缝塔中圆。\n祖翁血脉今何在，老树乌啼月满天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29190,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"枯干开梅","author":"行溗","text":"谁种窗前腊月梅，霜姿铁干一枝开。\n百花与我无交涉，独许寒香到枕来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29191,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村院秋居","author":"行悦","text":"鸡犬不时闻，村深俗亦淳。\n道情亲易久，乡语译方真。\n田坂斜阳淡，枫林秋色贫。\n因恩在庐岳，冰雪早侵人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29192,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜仙裳先生过访","author":"行定","text":"柴门常自掩，有客叩方开。\n因得支公语，遥知叔度来。\n风高披竟日，情洽竟忘杯。\n独愧东林远，相携去复回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29193,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜泊话旧","author":"行演","text":"曳衲西风古渡寒，一帆落日问惊湍。\n不愁暝色横天外，为有钟声出树端。\n相得自忘村野僻，频来转觉道情宽。\n当年禅学同烟水，更向镫前叙夙欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29194,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偕指月云岸一晓访顾茂伦","author":"行荃","text":"云水才栖息，南林复送行。\n只因尔我意，互作主宾情。\n远树迎风冷，虚舟载月明。\n已知寻梦趣，渡口暮烟横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29195,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿焦山绿雪庵","author":"行泰","text":"朝朝江北望江南，欲解愁怀复一探。\n夜静钟声沈竹榻，月明禅语出萝龛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29196,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽元植居士","author":"行遍","text":"知己非难遇，钟期后有谁。\n至人元不死，大造总无私。\n秋雨竹痕重，凉飔月魄移。\n诔词空自发，三哭欲何为。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29197,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"平山堂","author":"行照","text":"广陵山阁好跻攀，放眼乾坤夕照閒。\n十里松涛传石磬，万重云树接江关。\n雷塘尚积千秋恨，法海旋偷半日閒。\n幸得有人同此意，五泉亭上竟忘还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29198,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梵阁","author":"行照","text":"凭虚梵阁倚晴空，无限伤心一望中。\n六代繁华浑已尽，塞鸿犹叫五更风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29199,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过优昙禅院","author":"行鉴","text":"为访优昙遗迹来，碑残零落杂莓苔。\n三春腊月犹多积，二月梅花尚未开。\n绀殿虽经新匠斧，老松还是昔人栽。\n祖师面目依然在，了了分明不用猜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29200,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题芦墟泗州寺","author":"超慧","text":"泽国芦花满野霜，寺桥寒月照苍苍。\n不堪夜泊钟残后，落尽秋声雁几行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29201,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阳山结茅杂咏 其一","author":"实乘","text":"群峰炫苍翠，变化非一颜。\n我屋苍翠中，真可忘其年。\n但观心似云，岂知身在山。\n清机发深省，谷响为吾宣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29202,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阳山结茅杂咏 其二","author":"实乘","text":"微云度秋河，细雨不成阴。\n幽人望明月，一叶下空林。\n抚景生太息，凉飙动商音。\n因观岩上松，证我岁寒心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29203,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏山中即景","author":"实乘","text":"芳春景已移，且试山中乐。\n孤筇步幽厓，新林荡寂寞。\n清和景物佳，掩映朝岚薄。\n岩栖已岁馀，相对俨如昨。\n何从寄雅怀，于此契酬酢。\n鸟逐岚光散，花随磬声落。\n为言素心人，遐赏愿有作。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29204,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧隐","author":"实乘","text":"孤馆静无人，飞花竞狼藉。\n阳春忽己徂，愁思起日夕。\n念彼远峰青，面此浮云白。\n苍苍屋后松，巢鹤待归客。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29205,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮感事","author":"陈遇","text":"打头矮屋自欹斜，容膝真堪处士家。\n藓径人稀来往屐，纸窗梅放两三花。\n稻粱谋比衔芦雁，岁月忙如赴壑蛇。\n好听瓶笙啸清昼，炉烧柏子自煎茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29206,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]